 <h3><u>Mai hu paani suno meri kahani</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Main hi taskeene labe tishna dahan hota hoon&nbsp;<br> Kabhi darya kabhi aankhon se rawa hota hoon&nbsp;<br> Hain labe Asgare besheer ka ehsaan mujh par&nbsp;<br> Ho jahan majlis e Shabbir waha hota hoon&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani Auno meri kahani...x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Zindagi jisse rawa hain woh rawani main hoon&nbsp;<br> Pyaas ko jisse hain nisbat woh kahani main hoon&nbsp;<br> Be talab hoon talabe tishna dahani main hoon&nbsp;<br> Jab ye abaadi na thi tab se hi aabad hu main&nbsp;<br> Khud hain Quran gawah duniya ki buniyad hoon main&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani..x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Rahi har daur me masoomon se nisbat mujhko&nbsp;<br> Kar na paya koi paband shariat mujhko&nbsp;<br> Paak hoon aur taharat se hain ulfat mujhko&nbsp;<br> Khud sada deti rahi pyaas ne fitrat mujhko&nbsp;<br> Darde dil ke liye taskeen ka malham bankar&nbsp;<br> PAYE masoom se nikla hoon main zam zam bankar&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani....x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Mere qisse hain bohot meri kahani hain bohot&nbsp;<br> Barsare roo e zameen meri nishaani hain bohot&nbsp;<br> Khittae khushk hain kam dehr me paani hain bohot&nbsp;<br> Rabbe Akbar ne bada martaba bakhsha hain mujhe&nbsp;<br> Sayyada ke jo haqe mehr main rakkha hain mujhe&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani ...x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Main wuzu banke namazon ki ada tak pohoncha&nbsp;<br> Banke zam zam kabhi kaabe ki faza tak pohoncha&nbsp;<br> Main tha pakeeza so main rahe wila tak pohoncha&nbsp;<br> Yehi nisbat thi Jo main karbobala tak pohoncha&nbsp;<br> Do Moharram ko to alag the hi nazaare mere&nbsp;<br> Utre alfaaq ke malik jo kanare mere&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani....x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Roze Aashur main ek aur hi duniya main raha&nbsp;<br> Ashk bankar nigahe Sayyada Zehra main raha&nbsp;<br> Roshni banke kahi didae bina main raha&nbsp;<br> Auje kausain mila mashke Sakina main raha&nbsp;<br> Sare maidan e wiga maujeza dikhlata raha&nbsp;<br> Hukme Sheh hota toh khaimon main chala aata main&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani....x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Rubaru tha mera bemislo misaale chehra&nbsp;<br> Chehrae Hazrat e Abbas woh aali chehra&nbsp;<br> Hashmi chand ka chehra tha jamali chehra&nbsp;<br> Maine dekha tha jo gazi ka jalaali chehra&nbsp;<br> Khauf tab se hi mere dil se juda rehta hain&nbsp;<br> Bas usi din se mera rang uda rehta hain&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani...x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Aaya jab Saniye Karraar kanaare mere&nbsp;<br> Auj par pohonche muqaddar ke sitaare mere&nbsp;<br> Mashk me jaane ko betaab the dhaare mere&nbsp;<br> Sadqe khud pyaas ne aa aake utare mere&nbsp;<br> Roze Aashur yeh azmat bhi mili hain mujhko&nbsp;<br> Daste Abbas pe Maeraj hui hhain mujhko&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani...x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Log ab majlise Shabbir me late hain mujhe&nbsp;<br> Sadqa Shabbir ka pyaason ko Pilate hain mujhe&nbsp;<br> Matami Shah ke aankhon se lagate hain mujhe&nbsp;<br> Jab azadaar sabeelon me sajate hain mujhe&nbsp;<br> Zakhm e jaa saare hi seene ke liye aate hain&nbsp;<br> Ambiya bhi mujhe peene ke liye aate hain&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani. ..x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Yu mujhe sahebe zeeshan kiya pyaason ne&nbsp;<br> Dil e momin ka ek armaan kiya pyaason ne&nbsp;<br> Zaat par meri hi ehsaan kiya pyaason ne&nbsp;<br> Apni majlis ka mehmaan kiya pyaason ne&nbsp;<br> Mujhme taaseere dare Karbobala milti hain&nbsp;<br> Mujhko peele to farishton ko shifa milti hain&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani... x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Kya hain azmat meri aye duniya zara kar insaaf&nbsp;<br> Dhoke kar deta hoon har daag e nidamat ko saaf&nbsp;<br> Ek ajab kaam yeh karta hoon main fitrat ke khilaaf&nbsp;<br> Turbat e Hazrat e Abbas ka karta hoon tawaf&nbsp;<br> Mujhe yoon saya hain gazi ki alamdari ka&nbsp;<br> Laazmi hissa hoon main aaj azadari ka&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani.....x2&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>Dil me ek noor ke didar ki hasrat lekar&nbsp;<br> Hoon rawa noor Ali main yeh taharat lekar&nbsp;<br> Dekh Farhan sharaf leke sharafat lekar&nbsp;<br> Main hi chalta hoon arizon ki amanat lekar&nbsp;<br> Rashk kyu kar na kare auj e suraiya mujh par&nbsp;<br> Baarwa aake bichaega musalla mujh par&nbsp;<br> Main hoon paani....x2.</p> 
